      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dharkii Wadaadka Sare",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay buluuggii, iyo guduudkii, iyo casaankii ka sameeyeen dhar aad u wanaagsan in meesha quduuskaa lagaga adeego, oo waxay kaloo sameeyeen dharkii quduuska ahaa oo Haaruun, sidii Rabbigu Muuse ku amray.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eefodka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo eefodkiina wuxuu ka sameeyey dahab, iyo buluug, iyo guduud, iyo casaan, iyo maro wanaagsan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay dahabkii u tumeen sidii caleemo khafiif ah oo kale, markaasay googooyeen oo silig ka dhigeen, in looga shaqeeyo buluuggii, iyo guduudkii, iyo casaankii, iyo maradii wanaagsanayd, oo la daabacay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay u sameeyeen garbo is-haystay, oo waxay iska haysteen labada daraf. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dhex-xidhkii daabaca lahaa oo dusha kaga yiil in lagu xidho, isku waslad buu la ahaa eefodka, isku sina waa loo sameeyey, waxaana laga sameeyey dahab, iyo buluug, iyo guduud, iyo casaan, iyo maro wanaagsan, sidii Rabbigu Muuse ku amray.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay diyaariyeen dhagaxyadii onika la odhan jiray, oo ku jira saldhigyo dahab ah, oo lagu xardhay xaradhkii shaabadda oo ah sida ay magacyadii reer binu Israa'iil ahaayeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu ku dhejiyey eefodka garbihiisa, inay dhagaxyo xusuus ah u noqdaan reer binu Israa'iil, sidii Rabbigu Muuse ku amray.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Laabgashiga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu sameeyey laabgashigii, oo la daabacay, oo u eg sida samaynta eefodka oo kale, oo ahayd dahab, iyo buluug, iyo guduud, iyo casaan, iyo maro wanaagsan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuxuu ahaa afargeesood, oo laabgashiga waxay u sameeyeen labanlaab, oo dhererkiisu wuxuu ahaa taako, ballaadhkiisuna wuxuu ahaa taako isagoo labanlaaban. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay ku dul dhejiyeen afar saf oo dhagaxyo ah; oo safka kowaad wuxuu ahaa sardiyos, iyo tobasiyos, iyo mid birqaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Safka labaadna wuxuu ahaa sumurud, iyo safayr, iyo dheemman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Safka saddexaadna wuxuu ahaa yakintos, iyo agate, iyo ametustos. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Safka afraadna wuxuu ahaa berullos, iyo onika, iyo yasbid; oo waxaa lagu dhejiyey saldhigyo dahab ah oo meeshooda ku yaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dhagaxyaduna waxay tiro le'ekaayeen magacyadii reer binu Israa'iil, oo waxay ahaayeen laba iyo toban sidii magacyadoodii; oo laba iyo tobankii qabiil, mid kasta waxaa magiciisa loogu xardhay sidii xaradhkii shaabadda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo laabgashiga waxay ku sameeyeen silsilado xadhko u eg, oo laga tidcay dahab saafi ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay sameeyeen laba saldhig oo dahab ah, iyo laba siddo oo dahab ah, oo waxay labadii siddo sudheen laabgashiga labadiisa daraf. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo labadii silsiladood oo dahabka ahayd oo tidcanaydna waxay ku xidheen labadii siddo oo ku yiil darfaha laabgashiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo labadii silsiladood oo tidcanayd labadoodii madax oo kalena waxay ku xidheen labadii saldhig, oo waxay ku xidheen eefodka garbihiisa xaggooda hore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay sameeyeen laba siddo oo dahab ah, oo waxay soo sudheen laabgashiga labadiisa daraf oo gudaha ah oo eefodka xiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay kaloo sameeyeen laba siddo oo dahab ah, oo waxay soo sudheen eefodka garbihiisa xaggooda hoose, oo dhanka hore ku yaal, oo ku dhow meeshay iskaga xidhmaan, oo ka sarreeya suunka eefodka dhex-xidhkiisa daabaca ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo laabgashigii waxay siddooyinkiisii ku xidheen siddooyinkii eefodka, waxayna kula xidheen shalash buluug ah, inuu ku dul xidhnaado dhex-xidhka daabaca ah oo eefodka, iyo inuusan laabgashigu ka debcin eefodka, sidii Rabbigu Muuse ku amray.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Khamiiskii Wadaadka Sare",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo khamiiskii eefodkana wuxuu ahaa dhar samaysan, oo kulligiis buluug ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo daloolkii khamiiska ku yiil wuxuu ahaa sida daloolka dhar afkiisa rigrig ku wareegsan yahay, si uusan u dillaacin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo khamiiska darafkiisa hoose waxay ku sameeyeen rummaanno buluug, iyo guduud, iyo casaan ah, iyo maro wanaagsan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay sameeyeen dawanno dahab saafi ah, oo dawannadii waxay kala dhex geliyeen rummaannadii ku yiil khamiiska darafkiisa ku wareegsan, oo u dhexeeya rummaannadii; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo dawan iyo rummaan, haddana dawan iyo rummaan, ayuu ku wareejiyey khamiiska dharafkiisa, in lagu adeego aawadeed, sidii Rabbigu Muuse ku amray.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
