          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo laambaddii saafiga ahayd, iyo laambadaheedii, kuwaasoo ah laambadihii la diyaarin lahaa, iyo alaabtoodii oo dhan, iyo saliiddii lagu shidi lahaa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo meeshii allabariga oo dahabka ahayd, iyo saliiddii lagu subkan lahaa, iyo fooxii udgoonaa, iyo daahii iridda teendhada, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo meeshii allabariga oo naxaasta ahayd, iyo shabaggeedii naxaasta ahaa, iyo ulaheedii, iyo alaabteedii oo dhan, iyo berkeddii weysada, iyo salkeedii, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo barxadda daahyadeedii, iyo tiirarkeedii, iyo saldhigyadeedii, iyo daahii iridda barxadda, iyo xadhkihiisii, iyo musmaarradiisii, iyo alaabtii lagu qaban lahaa hawsha taambuugga oo dhan, teendhada shirka aawadeed, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo dharkii loo sameeyey in lagaga adeego meesha quduuska ah, iyo dharkii quduuska ahaa oo wadaadka Haaruun ah, iyo dharkii wiilashiisa, ee loogu sameeyey inay kaga adeegaan hawsha wadaadnimada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kulli wixii Rabbigu Muuse ku amray oo dhan reer binu Israa'iil sidii bay hawshii u wada qabteen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Muuse wuxuu arkay shuqulkii oo dhan, oo bal eeg way wada sameeyeen; sidii Rabbigu ku amray ayay u sameeyeen; markaasaa Muuse iyagii u duceeyey.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.43"
            ]
          }
